---
description: Use the git identity that matches this folder
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git identity

Commit as `Your Name <you@example.com>`.

- Do not override local git `user.*`.
- Hosting account for this tree: `your-github-user` (or the GitLab user for this folder).
- Confirm with the user before any push.

If this workspace has more than one client or org tree, spell the mapping in a table (folder → email → account) instead of a single line.
